  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCorporation Tax\n\t\tCorporation Tax FAQs\n\n### How to attach PDF accounts to CT600 manually?\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Mon, 25 Mar, 2019 at  1:30 PM\n\n\t\tYou may attach PDF accounts report using File Attachment available in Quick Entry tab by clicking on edit option available for the CT600 return and update the same under Accounts and Computations Included >> If you are not attaching accounts, say why not >> PDF Accounts attached with an explanation. \n\nOnce done, you may proceed to submit the CT600 return to HMRC as desired.\n\nPlease refer below screenshot for more help.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115346\">Corporation Tax</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188546\">Corporation Tax FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How to attach PDF accounts to CT600 manually?\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Mon, 25 Mar, 2019 at  1:30 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">You may attach PDF accounts report using File Attachment available in Quick Entry tab by clicking on edit option available for the CT600 return and update the same under Accounts and Computations Included &gt;&gt; If you are not attaching accounts, say why not &gt;&gt; PDF Accounts attached with an explanation. </span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Once done, you may proceed to submit the CT600 return to HMRC as desired.<br><br>Please refer below screenshot for more help.</span><br><br><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074129888/original/Z6KrH_I4_oK1kff3Nwt_lAz_3PwyKBccbQ.png?1553520550\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074129888/original/Z6KrH_I4_oK1kff3Nwt_lAz_3PwyKBccbQ.png?1553520550\" data-fileid=\"9074129888\" data-uniquekey=\"1553520533963\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074129887/original/cRb0g13MRmHXEzNQOaClojq_RYCoi_CBEw.png?1553520550\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074129887/original/cRb0g13MRmHXEzNQOaClojq_RYCoi_CBEw.png?1553520550\" data-fileid=\"9074129887\" data-uniquekey=\"1553520533963\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074129885/original/hTVcf_9M3Xc8-Gkc3scrR7M6wK1pSAWeyQ.png?1553520549\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074129885/original/hTVcf_9M3Xc8-Gkc3scrR7M6wK1pSAWeyQ.png?1553520549\" data-fileid=\"9074129885\" data-uniquekey=\"1553520533963\"><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165575\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165575/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165575\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165575/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedback-form\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165575\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-hide-dom=\"#voting-container\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo</span></span></p><a class=\"hide a-link\" 